@foafos/textnaut: notices
============================

The code in this package (the launcher, the Textnaut program and the TypeScript it imports) is
Apache-2.0; see LICENSE. The package has no runtime npm dependencies.

The package does not contain the engine. On first use of a page it downloads one pinned release
asset, foafnaut-web.tar.gz from build-386f8fb43f73-foafnaut-web of github.com/danbri/factoidal-builds
(sha256 in engine-pin.json), and keeps two files from it: web-render.mjs and web-render.wasm.
Those two files are a build of the Factoidal engine (Apache-2.0) and carry the third-party
components below. Screensavers and --help need no engine.

Libraries of an installed foafnaut (~/.foafnaut), if you point Textnaut at one, are not part of
this package and carry their own notices; the macOS library statically links GMP (LGPL), which the
Wasm engine does not.

